        "title": "3. `use-expo-stream.ts` - Expo Bar Status",
        "content": "\n",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "title": "Untested Functions",
        "content": "- `getAgentKvps` type guard\n- `getRandomJoke`\n- `extractFromLogs`\n- `useExpoStream` hook\n\n",
